acme/probes 1.0.0: 2 kind(s) a document can be, and 1 abstract kind(s) no document is: governed_document

probe
  is a      governed_document
  purpose   evidence: record what was observed and what it supports
  shelf     probes (docs/probes/**)
  facets    status, summary, title, probe_category, expectation, oracle, action
  sections  Task, Target, Key
  draft     headwater new probe --title "<title>"
  when      the taxonomy declares no trigger for this kind, and its purpose declares no answers

probe_transcript
  is a      governed_document
  purpose   evidence: record what was observed and what it supports
  shelf     probe_runs (docs/probe-runs/**)
  facets    status, summary, title, tier, arm
  sections  Run identity, Events
  draft     headwater new probe_transcript --title "<title>"
  when      the taxonomy declares no trigger for this kind, and its purpose declares no answers
